\f1\b\fs36 \cf2 7. Crucial Reminder on Self-Assessments\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf2 Self-assessment questionnaires are 
\f1\b snapshots of self-perception, not absolute diagnoses or permanent labels
\f0\b0 . They measure how you perceive and report your tendencies at a single point in time, influenced by your current stress levels, role context, and mood.\
\
Use these results as a tool for personal reflection and continuous improvement. Always respect your colleagues' privacy and dignity by avoiding analyzing, labeling, or diagnosing others using similar concepts. Genuine leadership growth happens through daily, observable behavioral adjustments and open dialog\'97not psychometric classifications.\
